# Figma source

This app is linked to the Auto-Bus Figma file. Treat it as the design source of truth.

- File: [Auto-Bus](https://www.figma.com/design/vDEDLxCPolEKtncF1Brucp/Auto-Bus)
- File key: `vDEDLxCPolEKtncF1Brucp`
- Light UI page: [NEW DESIGNS](https://www.figma.com/design/vDEDLxCPolEKtncF1Brucp/Auto-Bus?node-id=3229-10) (`3229:10`)
- Project map: `figma.json`

When changing UI, icons, colors, type, or layout:

1. Read from this Figma file (do not invent a different design).
2. Font is Poppins. Type sits 1px under Figma (`LightScreenTheme.typeTitle` = 15, body 13, label 12, caption 11) so Poppins does not look oversized. Do not multiply font sizes by screen `scale`. Headings use `FontWeight.w500`.
3. Use exported assets in `assets/icons/figma/` and `assets/img/figma/`.
4. Render icons with `FigmaSvgIcon` / `FigmaIcons`, not SF Symbol stand-ins, when a Figma SVG exists.
